      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki per Ki Blast</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a barrage of individual ki blasts. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> on a hit. You can fire a number of ki blasts up to a max of your <em>Proficiency Bonus.</em></p>\n",
